Feature: Strategic Sourcing Director Portfolio Management
  As Jennifer Kim, Strategic Sourcing Director
  I want to strategically manage supplier portfolio across multiple categories
  So that I can build resilient supplier relationships and drive competitive advantage across $12B annual spend

  Background:
    Given I am logged in as Jennifer Kim, Strategic Sourcing Director
    And I have access to the strategic sourcing portfolio management system
    And I manage 8 category teams with 45 people across North America
    And I oversee $12B annual spend across multiple categories

  @portfolio-analytics @strategic-planning
  Scenario: Analyze supplier portfolio performance across all categories
    Given I need to prepare for quarterly strategy review meeting
    When I access the portfolio analytics dashboard
    Then I should see performance metrics across all managed categories
    And I should see supplier diversification status by category
    And I should see cost savings achievement by category team
    And I should see relationship health scores for strategic suppliers
    And I should be able to identify categories needing immediate attention

  @market-entry @supplier-development
  Scenario: Develop market entry strategy for new sourcing region
    Given I want to establish sourcing capabilities in Vietnam
    And Vietnam represents a new market for our supplier base
    When I initiate a market entry analysis for Vietnam
    Then I should see comprehensive market assessment including:
      | Assessment Area          | Details                                    |
      | Supplier landscape       | Available suppliers by category           |
      | Manufacturing capability | Production capacity and technology levels |
      | Regulatory environment   | Compliance requirements and standards     |
      | Infrastructure          | Logistics and transportation capabilities |
      | Risk factors            | Political, economic, and operational risks |
    And I should get prioritized recommendations for category entry sequence
    And I should receive timeline estimates for market establishment

  @supplier-relationship-management @strategic-partnerships
  Scenario: Develop strategic supplier partnership roadmaps
    Given I want to build deeper partnerships with top 20 suppliers
    When I access strategic supplier relationship management tools
    Then I should see current relationship health scores for all strategic suppliers
    And I should see partnership development opportunities by supplier
    And I should be able to create joint innovation roadmaps
    And I should track investment in supplier development programs
    And I should measure ROI on strategic supplier relationships

  @team-management @resource-allocation
  Scenario: Optimize resource allocation across category teams
    Given I need to allocate limited resources across 8 category teams
    And each team has different strategic priorities and workloads
    When I analyze team performance and resource needs
    Then I should see current workload and performance metrics by team
    And I should see strategic project priorities and resource requirements
    And I should receive recommendations for resource reallocation
    And I should be able to model impact of different resource allocation scenarios

  @innovation-pipeline @supplier-innovation
  Scenario: Manage supplier innovation pipeline and partnerships
    Given I have a target of 20+ new products/innovations annually from suppliers
    When I review the supplier innovation pipeline
    Then I should see current innovation projects by supplier and category
    And I should see innovation pipeline value and timeline projections
    And I should track supplier innovation capabilities and investments
    And I should identify opportunities for joint innovation partnerships
    And I should measure innovation ROI and time-to-market metrics

  @scenario-planning @strategic-modeling
  Scenario: Model different portfolio diversification scenarios
    Given I need to evaluate multiple approaches to supplier diversification
    When I use scenario planning tools for portfolio optimization
    Then I should be able to model different diversification strategies
    And I should see impact projections for cost, risk, and timeline
    And I should compare scenarios based on multiple criteria:
      | Criteria                 | Importance |
      | Risk reduction          | High       |
      | Cost impact            | High       |
      | Implementation timeline | Medium     |
      | Supplier relationships  | Medium     |
      | Innovation potential    | Medium     |
    And I should be able to select optimal scenario for execution

  @cross-category-coordination @synergy-identification
  Scenario: Identify synergies and coordination opportunities across categories
    Given multiple categories may benefit from coordinated supplier strategies
    When I analyze cross-category supplier overlaps and opportunities
    Then I should see suppliers that serve multiple categories
    And I should identify opportunities for volume consolidation
    And I should see potential synergies in supplier development investments
    And I should receive recommendations for cross-category coordination
    And I should be able to track benefits from coordinated strategies

  @performance-measurement @roi-tracking
  Scenario: Track ROI on strategic sourcing investments and initiatives
    Given I invest significantly in supplier development and market entry
    When I evaluate ROI on strategic sourcing investments
    Then I should see financial returns from supplier development programs
    And I should see cost savings achieved through strategic initiatives
    And I should track risk mitigation value from diversification efforts
    And I should measure innovation value from supplier partnerships
    And I should be able to justify continued investment in strategic programs

  @competitive-intelligence @market-positioning
  Scenario: Monitor competitive positioning and industry benchmarking
    Given I need to ensure MegaMart maintains competitive sourcing advantages
    When I access competitive intelligence and benchmarking data
    Then I should see how our supplier portfolio compares to industry standards
    And I should see competitive sourcing strategies and supplier moves
    And I should identify opportunities to establish competitive advantages
    And I should track market trends that could impact sourcing strategies

  @stakeholder-communication @executive-reporting
  Scenario: Communicate strategic sourcing progress to executive leadership
    Given I need to report on strategic sourcing progress to the CPO and CEO
    When I prepare executive communication materials
    Then I should have presentation-ready strategic sourcing scorecards
    And I should show progress toward diversification and risk reduction goals
    And I should highlight key strategic wins and relationship developments
    And I should present clear recommendations for continued executive support
    And I should be able to customize reports for different executive audiences

  @change-management @team-development
  Scenario: Lead organizational transformation toward strategic sourcing excellence
    Given I want to transform team capabilities and organizational maturity
    When I assess current team capabilities and development needs
    Then I should see individual and team skill assessments
    And I should identify capability gaps for strategic sourcing excellence
    And I should create development roadmaps for team members
    And I should track progress toward strategic sourcing maturity goals
    And I should measure team engagement and retention in transformation efforts
